        <name>AudioContextStatusCallback</name>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Callback for asynchronous Audio Context status requests. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>If <computeroutput>result</computeroutput> is not <computeroutput><ref refid="group___audio_1gga8089069793b83dbee70b61b885099409af0f0a4afed3759ff279f0d56ce0fc7d8" kindref="member">AudioContextAvailabilityAvailable</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput>status</computeroutput> may be NULL. The callback runs on the app event loop. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
        <location file="build/sdk/emery/include/pebble.h" line="3424" column="9" bodyfile="build/sdk/emery/include/pebble.h" bodystart="3424" bodyend="-1"/>
