        <briefdescription>
<para>Gets the most recent cached Audio Context status. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function does not contact the phone. Before a status response has been received, the cached availability is <computeroutput><ref refid="group___audio_1gga8089069793b83dbee70b61b885099409a73adc4f50e981e808b0e1519fb761b3f" kindref="member">AudioContextAvailabilityUnsupportedPhone</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
